---
const { brand } = Astro.props;

if (!brand || !brand.visualData || !brand.visualData.bandwidth) {
  return null;
}

const data = brand.visualData.bandwidth;
---
<div class="mb-8 w-full max-w-4xl bg-brand-dark/30 border border-brand-accent/20 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(56,189,248,0.05)]">
  <div class="flex items-center mb-6 border-b border-white/5 pb-4">
    <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-neon mr-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
    </svg>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-wider">
      PEAK BANDWIDTH / <span class="text-slate-400">峰值带宽</span>
    </h3>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4">
    {data.map((item) => (
      <div class="bg-brand-navy border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center transition-colors hover:border-brand-neon/50">
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2 font-mono">{item.label || item.plan}</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-neon tracking-wider">{item.display || `${item.value} Mbps`}</div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  
  <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 text-center italic mt-4">
    * 峰值带宽为官方套餐页面标示，不代表实际连接持续达到该速度。
  </p>
</div>
